      "uid": "zhcn:82ce7a73357818da466ed00b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "果然要去香港的话，美食得品尝吧。\n爸爸的事务所附近，有一家我推荐的茶餐厅，一起去吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c505b55dd8ceb15129292ea05d305494d070d794cada1ccd3937e93e51efd1f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
