    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddb367aba1cdf834cf2da8d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着最重要的，肯定不能忘了看夜景。难得在那边待久一点，\n一定要看看夜晚的维多利亚港！　还有――",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f5d6ee4febbeb480fba37682b161f9ebcfd9f877d55c49ab24ec8073d11a0ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1088/storytimeline_041088007.json",
      "json_path": [
