      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37fb4136c1e26e2291d23f22",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "海的那边……是指旅行……？\n这样的话最近没有要去旅行的安排。那我该说――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9c35675a46c09521bb2d700f65341d49074497437b20eee9938960185c73566",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1088/storytimeline_041088007.json",
      "json_path": [
